p Historian was a proof of concept exercise to redesign the browser's history page for faster recall.

!= partial("../_partials/_post_image", { image: "../assets/images/historian/screen_1.png", description: "Redesigned Google Chrome history page" })

p The focus was on improving search by providing information of events and interactions that occured surrounding a page's visit. Media-heavy webpages were represented visually through thumbnails. Historian’s visual design focused on presenting the increased content without overwhelming the user.

p The timeline is a key piece of the redesign, providing a sequential overview of the entire browsing history and faster access to inter-site movement.

